  "details": "Description:\nSome generic avatars will not show locally in mirror, but some will. If you have an animator on the root of the Generic avatar, it works and shows. If you do not have an animator on the root of the Generic avatar, it will not show in mirror reflections locally.\n\nGeneric Avatars that do not reflect locally:\n<snip>\n\nGeneric Avatars that do reflect locally:\n<snip>\n\nRepro Steps:\nWear one of the avatars listed above. \nGo to a world with a mirror.\nObserve yourself in the mirror. Optionally, have someone present.\nExpected:\nYou see yourself in the mirror as expected.\n\nActual:\nAvatars listed above under \"Generic Avatars that do not reflect locally\" do not show in the mirror. Oddly, lights that are on the avatars still cast on nearby geometry/avatars.",
